invalid type: string "\n                Title: Internal Phishing from Compromised Mailbox\n                Affected systems: ['Microsoft 365', 'Email']\n                Indicators: ['Malicious messages from internal account', 'Credential harvesting URL', 'Multiple employee clicks']\n                Summary: A compromised employee mailbox was used to send phishing messages to colleagues.\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ